  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Comments: The audio source for live input is set to output on a muted mixer channel
    to prevent audio feedback from occurring.
  Warning: Note that if the AudioSource itself is muted then no audio processing
    occurs. By using an AudioMixer channel to mute the output, it happens downstream
    while still allowing the AudioSurce input to be processed for audio reactive
    behavior.
